Feature: Gherkin Reader
  Explain that a Gherkin File will be referenced by filename
  
  Background:
    Given   I want to use the GherkinReader
    
  Scenario: Gherkin Reader successfully loads a Gherkin File
    When    I load "gherkinreader.gherkin"
    Then    I am successful
    And     I have loaded 3 tests
    And     the first test has 5 sentences
    
  Scenario: Gherkin Reader throws an error during load if there are multiple backgrounds
    When    I load "gherkinreader.multiple_backgrounds.gherkin"
    Then    I am not successful
    And     I get an exception with message "Duplicated Background clause"
    
  Scenario: Gherkin Reader throws an error during load if a step is not implemented
    When    I load "gherkinreader.not_implemented.gherkin"
    Then    I am not successful
    And     I get an exception with message "Step does not match any implementation"